OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F403A1785174511
OL,3,CProtesters demand withdrawal of use of
OL,4,CUK military bases from US-Iran war
OL,6,FAnti-war protesters gathered outside
OL,7,Fthe main gates of RAF Fairford to call
OL,8,Fon Prime Minister Andy Burnham to
OL,9,Fwithdraw the use of UK military bases
OL,10,Ffrom the US's war with Iran.
OL,12,FSo far, the UK has allowed the US to
OL,13,Flaunch "defensive" operations from
OL,14,FBritish bases hosting American
OL,15,Fpersonnel and aircraft, while refusing
OL,16,Fto co-operate in offensive operations
OL,17,Fagainst Iran.
OL,26,@uD@HOUuD@RO]
