FL,404,400,120,260,000,100
PN,40302
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F403A1785174511
OL,3,CProtesters demand withdrawal of use of
OL,4,CUK military bases from US-Iran war
OL,6,FDemonstrators from the Campaign for
OL,7,FNuclear Disarmament (CND) and Fairford
OL,8,FAction held signs and chanted outside
OL,9,Fthe Gloucestershire military base on
OL,10,FSaturday.
OL,12,FThe protesters say their action
OL,13,Ffollows an attack on Iran by a US B-1
OL,14,Fbomber stationed at RAF Fairford
OL,15,Fearlier this week, which led to Iran's
OL,16,FForeign Ministry branding Britain as
OL,17,Fan "accomplice" in the US's war.
OL,26,@yD@DOUyD@OO]
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G2/6
