OL,24,ANext Page BSW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,404,400,120,260,000,100
PN,40303
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F403A1785174511
OL,3,CProtesters demand withdrawal of use of
OL,4,CUK military bases from US-Iran war
OL,6,FCND general secretary Sophie Bolt
OL,7,Fsaid: "New Prime Minister Andy Burnham
OL,8,Fneeds to end (US President Donald)
OL,9,FTrump's use of Fairford and Diego
OL,10,FGarcia now.
OL,12,F"This is dragging Britain directly
OL,13,Finto Trump's illegal war on Iran.
OL,15,F"Public opposition to the use of
OL,16,FBritish bases to commit war crimes
OL,17,Foverseas is growing.
OL,19,F"Diplomatic pathways to achieve a
OL,20,Fpeaceful resolution to Iran's nuclear
OL,21,Fprogramme have been shown to work.
OL,26,@oD@GOUtD@AOUwD@AOU{D@AOU
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G3/6
