PN,40304
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F403A1785174511
OL,3,CProtesters demand withdrawal of use of
OL,4,CUK military bases from US-Iran war
OL,6,F"Trump's bombardment is only
OL,7,Fsabotaging this progress."
OL,9,FOn Friday new Defence Secretary Wes
OL,10,FStreeting is reported to have had a
OL,11,F"very warm conversation" with his US
OL,12,Fcounterpart Pete Hegseth.
OL,14,FAccording to a source close to Mr
OL,15,FStreeting, the pair brainstormed ideas
OL,16,Ffor an international conference which
OL,17,Fallies of the UK and US would attend,
OL,18,Fbut have not yet firmed up the details
OL,19,Fof a summit.
OL,26,@nD@AOUoD@ZO]sD@AOUsD@XO]
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G4/6
