OL,24,ANext Page BSW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,404,400,120,260,000,100
PN,40305
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F403A1785174511
OL,3,CProtesters demand withdrawal of use of
OL,4,CUK military bases from US-Iran war
OL,6,FMr Hegseth, the US secretary of war,
OL,7,Flast month lambasted European leaders
OL,8,Ffor denying the US unfettered use of
OL,9,Fbases.
OL,11,F"These allies, they put America's sons
OL,12,Fand daughters, our sons and daughters,
OL,13,Fat risk by denying them the
OL,14,Fpredictable access, basing and
OL,15,Foverflight that never should have been
OL,16,Fin question at all," he said.
OL,18,FMr Streeting's call with Mr Hegseth
OL,19,Ffollows a meeting between Foreign
OL,20,FSecretary Ed Miliband and Washington's
OL,21,Fsecretary of state Marco Rubio.
OL,26,@sD@AOUxD@TO]
