PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F403A1785174511
OL,3,CProtesters demand withdrawal of use of
OL,4,CUK military bases from US-Iran war
OL,6,FA UK government spokesperson said:
OL,7,F"Our Armed Forces are ready to keep
OL,8,Fthe United Kingdom safe from any kind
OL,9,Fof attacks, whether it's on our soil
OL,10,For from abroad. The UK stands ready 24/
OL,11,F7 to defend itself."
OL,13,F"The UK's approach to the conflict
OL,14,Fremains the same ` we are committed to
OL,15,Fdefending our people, our interests
OL,16,Fand ourallies, acting in accordance
OL,17,Fwith international law and not getting
OL,18,Fdrawn into the wider conflict."
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G6/6
